#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:2
msgid "FS (native)"
msgstr "FS（原生）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:4
msgid ""
"A file-system L2 adapter backed by the native C++ ``LMCacheFSClient`` "
"wrapped with ``NativeConnectorL2Adapter``.  I/O is dispatched through a "
"C++ worker-thread pool with eventfd-driven completions, giving a true I/O"
" queue depth on a single Python thread."
msgstr ""
"一个由原生 C++ ``LMCacheFSClient`` 支持的文件系统 L2 适配器，封装在 "
"``NativeConnectorL2Adapter`` 中。I/O 通过一个 C++ 工作线程池进行调度，使用 eventfd "
"驱动的完成机制，在单个 Python 线程上提供真实的 I/O 队列深度。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:9
msgid "**Required fields:**"
msgstr "**必填字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:11
msgid "``base_path``: Directory for storing KV cache files."
msgstr "``base_path``: 存储 KV Cache 文件的目录。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:13
msgid "**Optional fields:**"
msgstr "**可选字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:15
msgid ""
"``num_workers`` (int, default ``4``, > 0): Number of C++ worker threads "
"inside the connector.  This is the real I/O queue depth -- raise to push "
"throughput on filesystems whose aggregate BW exceeds per-stream BW."
msgstr ""
"``num_workers``\\ （int，默认值 ``4``\\ ，> 0）：连接器内部的 C++ 工作线程数量。这是真正的 I/O "
"队列深度——提高此值以在总带宽超过每个流带宽的文件系统上提升吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:19
msgid ""
"``relative_tmp_dir`` (str, default ``\"\"``): Relative sub-directory for "
"temporary files during writes (atomic rename on completion)."
msgstr "``relative_tmp_dir``\\ （str，默认值 ``\"\"``\\ ）：写入临时文件所使用的相对子目录，写入完成后执行原子重命名。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:21
msgid ""
"``use_odirect`` (bool, default ``false``): Bypass the page cache via "
"``O_DIRECT``.  Required to measure real disk bandwidth.  See alignment "
"caveat below."
msgstr ""
"``use_odirect``\\ （bool，默认值 ``false``\\ ）：通过 ``O_DIRECT`` "
"绕过页面缓存，启用后方可测量真实的磁盘带宽。请参阅下方的对齐注意事项。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:24
msgid ""
"``read_ahead_size`` (int, optional): Trigger filesystem readahead by "
"issuing a warm-up read of this many bytes at open time.  This is skipped "
"for reads that use ``O_DIRECT`` because direct I/O bypasses the page "
"cache."
msgstr "``read_ahead_size``\\\\ （int，可选）：通过在打开时发出此字节数的预热读取来触发文件系统预读取。对于使用 ``O_DIRECT`` 的读取，此操作将被跳过，因为直接 I/O 绕过了页面缓存。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:27
msgid ""
"``max_capacity_gb`` (float, default ``0``): Maximum L2 capacity in GB for"
" client-side usage tracking.  Default ``0`` disables tracking."
msgstr ""
"``max_capacity_gb``\\ （float，默认值 ``0``\\ ）：用于客户端使用量跟踪的最大 L2 容量（单位：GB）。默认值"
" ``0`` 表示禁用跟踪。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:32
msgid "``O_DIRECT`` has two independent alignment requirements:"
msgstr "``O_DIRECT`` 有两个独立的对齐要求："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Length alignment.**  The transfer length must be a multiple of the "
"filesystem's block size.  With ``use_odirect: true`` the adapter "
"automatically transfers each object's full alignment-padded L1 slot "
"(logical bytes plus padding up to ``--l1-align-bytes``), so this "
"requirement holds even when KV chunk byte sizes are not multiples of the "
"block size; on-disk files are correspondingly padded, and loads must run "
"with the same ``use_odirect`` and ``--l1-align-bytes`` settings as the "
"stores.  Raise ``--l1-align-bytes`` to match the block size on "
"filesystems with large blocks (GPFS and similar parallel filesystems "
"often use several MiB)."
msgstr "**长度对齐。**  传输长度必须是文件系统块大小的倍数。使用 ``use_odirect: true`` 时，适配器会自动传输每个对象的完整对齐填充 L1 槽（逻辑字节加上填充，直到 ``--l1-align-bytes``），因此即使 KV 块字节大小不是块大小的倍数，这个要求仍然成立；磁盘上的文件相应地进行了填充，加载时必须使用与存储相同的 ``use_odirect`` 和 ``--l1-align-bytes`` 设置。在块较大的文件系统上（GPFS 和类似的并行文件系统通常使用几个 MiB），请提高 ``--l1-align-bytes`` 以匹配块大小。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Memory-buffer alignment.**  The I/O buffer pointer itself must also be "
"aligned (typically to 4096 bytes on local disks, or to the FS block size "
"on parallel filesystems).  This is controlled by ``--l1-align-bytes`` "
"(default ``4096``) -- raise it to match the FS block size when running on"
" a filesystem with larger blocks.  If the buffer is misaligned, the "
"connector reports a runtime error instead of silently falling back to "
"buffered I/O.  This protects real-disk benchmark runs from accidentally "
"measuring the page cache."
msgstr "**内存缓冲区对齐。** I/O 缓冲区指针本身也必须对齐（通常在本地磁盘上对齐到 4096 字节，或在并行文件系统上对齐到 FS 块大小）。这由 ``--l1-align-bytes`` 控制（默认值为 ``4096``）——在使用块较大的文件系统时，将其提高以匹配 FS 块大小。如果缓冲区未对齐，连接器会报告运行时错误，而不是默默回退到缓冲 I/O。这可以保护真实磁盘基准测试运行，避免意外测量页面缓存。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:54
msgid ""
"If unsure, start with ``use_odirect: false`` and confirm correctness "
"before enabling ``O_DIRECT``."
msgstr "如果不确定，请先使用 ``use_odirect: false`` 并确认正确性，然后再启用 ``O_DIRECT``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:57
msgid "**Configuration examples:**"
msgstr "**配置示例：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/fs_native.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Buffer-only mode example.**  L1 acts as a pure write buffer that "
"absorbs the peak burst of in-flight chunks while the C++ worker pool "
"drains them to disk; nothing is retained in L1 once a store completes:"
msgstr ""
"**仅缓冲区模式示例。** L1 充当纯写缓冲区，吸收待处理数据块的峰值突发，同时 C++ 工作线程池将其排空至磁盘；存储完成后 L1 "
"中不保留任何内容："

